data: {"id": "993e9717cdfc4d17-thinking-parallel_evidence-981", "run_id": "993e9717cdfc4d17", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，针对 `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` 的异常状态和原因，分析如下：\n\n### 实体身份\n- **Pod**: `workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` (Namespace: `aiops-case-06`)\n- **UID**: `20db72b2-f223-4295-8f2d-62edd54cf1cd`\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app`\n\n### 1. 异常状态确认 (已恢复？否)\n- **事实**: `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示 Pod 的 `phase` 为 `Running`，但 `containerStatuses` 中 `app` 容器状态为 `ready=False`，`restarts=7`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`。\n- **事实**: `kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_events` 均确认存在 `Warning BackOff ... Back-off restarting f", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788437315657, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

